      "updated": 1731159985019,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "But instead of creating two different table like this MongoDB(NoSql Makes our task easy ) by providing nested Documnets\nso instead of creating two different table for author plus book and then link those table using a foregin key \nfor ease of access we can create a author collection with different author document haveing nested document which have\nbook info",
