      "index": "b0J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1280601379,
      "version": 400,
      "versionNonce": 259922125,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731164255507,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So compare to Sql database service mongodb is comperatively easy\nto implement read,write,update and delete operation plus it's\nvery fast",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So compare to Sql database service mongodb is comperatively easy\nto implement read,write,update and delete operation plus it's\nvery fast",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2TQr9vNPSqPfKlGo5CjoF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -251.51837693442076,
      "y": 72098.2592863877,
      "width": 1445.399169921875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 271417827,
      "version": 255,
      "versionNonce": 60670253,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731164131757,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So now unlike mysql we dont have table in no-sql but instead we have \ncollection which have document \n\nNow a database can have multiple collection,and collection have multiple \ndocuments ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So now unlike mysql we dont have table in no-sql but instead we have \ncollection which have document \n\nNow a database can have multiple collection,and collection have multiple \ndocuments ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
