      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731213074708,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now let's start interacting with mongosh (mongo shell)\n\n1.open a terminal and type : mongosh (make sure mongod as service is running in background in windows and \nfor mac use mongod --dbpath ~/data/db)\n\n2.We will be directed to the screen below it :",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now let's start interacting with mongosh (mongo shell)\n\n1.open a terminal and type : mongosh (make sure mongod as service is running in background in windows and \nfor mac use mongod --dbpath ~/data/db)\n\n2.We will be directed to the screen below it :",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
