    },
    {
      "id": "kLLKJbemVLLEQXWvRNnNt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -470.0477330185415,
      "y": 86745.13164065468,
      "width": 1663.19921875,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b16",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1438068675,
      "version": 574,
      "versionNonce": 1017902157,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731251356447,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now suppose we have a database bookstore and collection books suppose we have 200\ndocument in our collection and we say[db.books.find()] this will list the first \n20 document  out of 200 document and for  the next 20 we type:[it] which is iterate \nand it will fetch the next 20 document now this effect of find() in nodejs api\nis a bit different then in mongosh and we will see that later\n\n\nSuppose this is our books collection with all the document",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now suppose we have a database bookstore and collection books suppose we have 200\ndocument in our collection and we say[db.books.find()] this will list the first \n20 document  out of 200 document and for  the next 20 we type:[it] which is iterate \nand it will fetch the next 20 document now this effect of find() in nodejs api\nis a bit different then in mongosh and we will see that later\n\n\nSuppose this is our books collection with all the document",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "l0BprYz_Ap7JJneHpdaas",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -465.6990776883498,
      "y": 87126.87769242523,
      "width": 1194.1198120117188,
      "height": 1503.5782566339963,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b18",
