      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731262410753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now suppose we need to filter out the finding of our collection-document for that we use filter queries \nwhat are filters?\n\nWell in MongoDB Compass if we look carefully then we can see:\n",
      "fontSize": 47.06388610586526,
      "fontFamily": 8,
