      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now suppose we need to filter out the finding of our collection-document for that we use filter queries \nwhat are filters?\n\nWell in MongoDB Compass if we look carefully then we can see:\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
