      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731262404849,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Here we have filter form whoch takes a object \nas input with key and value to find document \nin that collection",
      "fontSize": 50.98241154944603,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Here we have filter form whoch takes a object \nas input with key and value to find document \nin that collection",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6JFo5Ho4cdFkDsYZfJDwp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -704.9110756215198,
      "y": 90724.625551925,
      "width": 2233.0792869932825,
      "height": 406.6494223270877,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 291731821,
      "version": 335,
      "versionNonce": 1436278275,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731263633089,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So via the use of filter we can find perticular document in our collection\n\nsuppose we need to find a document with author name as \"Brandon Sanderson\"\nwith rating 8 we can use filter in find as :\n\n",
      "fontSize": 54.21992297694502,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So via the use of filter we can find perticular document in our collection\n\nsuppose we need to find a document with author name as \"Brandon Sanderson\"\nwith rating 8 we can use filter in find as :\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DETKSbgf_3b5jTd7uyGxa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -669.8802424970468,
      "y": 91179.52620171689,
      "width": 1319.579253398315,
      "height": 1221.0788099082597,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 554731427,
      "version": 210,
      "versionNonce": 1201733219,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731262625147,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Then we will get the output as :\n\n {\n    _id:ObjectId(\"622a3bc0f493f1330ba0cd3b\"),\n    title:\"The final Empire \",\n    author:\"Brandon  Sanderson\",\n    pages:450,\n    genre:[\"fantasy\",\"dystopian\"],\n    rating:8\n },\n\n{\n    _id:ObjectId(\"622a3bc0f493f1330ba0cd3c\"),\n    title:\"The Way of  Kings\",\n    author:\"Brandon Sanderson\",\n    pages:350,\n    genre:[\"fantasy\",\"dystopian\"],\n    rating:8\n }  ",
      "fontSize": 51.41384462771624,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Then we will get the output as :\n\n {\n    _id:ObjectId(\"622a3bc0f493f1330ba0cd3b\"),\n    title:\"The final Empire \",\n    author:\"Brandon  Sanderson\",\n    pages:450,\n    genre:[\"fantasy\",\"dystopian\"],\n    rating:8\n },\n\n{\n    _id:ObjectId(\"622a3bc0f493f1330ba0cd3c\"),\n    title:\"The Way of  Kings\",\n    author:\"Brandon Sanderson\",\n    pages:350,\n    genre:[\"fantasy\",\"dystopian\"],\n    rating:8\n }  ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9Bgww8__iFWcVk8t7vFvz",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -675.5737117711235,
