      "updated": 1731263667944,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We can even revive specefic field in the document via passing a second argumnet\nsuppose we typed the below command :\n ",
      "fontSize": 56.82269762717056,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We can even revive specefic field in the document via passing a second argumnet\nsuppose we typed the below command :\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pMOhqko_DGoTxfKTKjqRV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -754.4724907031418,
      "y": 93064.46664202164,
      "width": 1783.211272273798,
      "height": 1606.6826446161326,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 554731427,
      "version": 479,
      "versionNonce": 1608156291,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1731263730333,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Then we will get the output as :\n\n {\n    _id:ObjectId(\"622a3bc0f493f1330ba0cd3b\"),\n    title:\"The final Empire \",\n    author:\"Brandon  Sanderson\",\n    pages:450,\n    genre:[\"fantasy\",\"dystopian\"],\n    rating:8\n },\n\n{\n    _id:ObjectId(\"622a3bc0f493f1330ba0cd3c\"),\n    title:\"The Way of  Kings\",\n    author:\"Brandon Sanderson\",\n    pages:350,\n    genre:[\"fantasy\",\"dystopian\"],\n    rating:8\n } \n\n\n\n\nNow in this document we only need the title and author field \nso we can pass it as a second argument in a object ",
      "fontSize": 51.41384462771624,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Then we will get the output as :\n\n {\n    _id:ObjectId(\"622a3bc0f493f1330ba0cd3b\"),\n    title:\"The final Empire \",\n    author:\"Brandon  Sanderson\",\n    pages:450,\n    genre:[\"fantasy\",\"dystopian\"],\n    rating:8\n },\n\n{\n    _id:ObjectId(\"622a3bc0f493f1330ba0cd3c\"),\n    title:\"The Way of  Kings\",\n    author:\"Brandon Sanderson\",\n    pages:350,\n    genre:[\"fantasy\",\"dystopian\"],\n    rating:8\n } \n\n\n\n\nNow in this document we only need the title and author field \nso we can pass it as a second argument in a object ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
