      "text": "Cause mongodb will treat this :\n[\"magical\"] as a single entity \narray and will try to find \ngenre with a single entity array \nwhich is not present so \nto querry through a array which has muliptle\nelement and we need to filter it out \nbased on one element isntead of passing it \nas array we pass as just value",
