      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731318423011,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deleting using mongosh\n-------------------------------------\nto delete a document in mongodb we have \ntwo main method :\n\n1.deleteOne(<filter>):now in delete one \nwe can one document by passing any filter \nin it but we make sure that the filter \nwe pass is unique like _id field so that \nthat perticular doucment gets deleted which \nwe want to delete and not any other ",
      "fontSize": 266.34004194296415,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deleting using mongosh\n-------------------------------------\nto delete a document in mongodb we have \ntwo main method :\n\n1.deleteOne(<filter>):now in delete one \nwe can one document by passing any filter \nin it but we make sure that the filter \nwe pass is unique like _id field so that \nthat perticular doucment gets deleted which \nwe want to delete and not any other ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
