    {
      "id": "FhSXp9hZJm9160Y7aCfkx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8560.42701877606,
      "y": 195447.84281342247,
      "width": 5421.8924560546875,
      "height": 1058.651876006493,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 641869453,
      "version": 438,
      "versionNonce": 1857025005,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731318854030,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So:db.books.deleteOne({ author: \"Brandon Sanderson\" })\nthis will delete the first record/document which it will \nfind that is \"The Final Empire\" but we wanted to delete\n\"The way of Kings\"\n",
      "fontSize": 169.38430016103888,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So:db.books.deleteOne({ author: \"Brandon Sanderson\" })\nthis will delete the first record/document which it will \nfind that is \"The Final Empire\" but we wanted to delete\n\"The way of Kings\"\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4QS0v77udZXXVsYarHtG8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9192.172900558067,
      "y": 197166.8892183264,
      "width": 8712.76859664917,
      "height": 1276.508326083648,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2092880909,
      "version": 299,
      "versionNonce": 658073539,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731318919011,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So,the best way is to pass a unique field to delete a specific\ndocument like _id \n\n[db.books.deleteOne({_id:ObjectId(\"22a3bc0f493f1330ba0cd3c\"})]",
      "fontSize": 255.30166521672967,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So,the best way is to pass a unique field to delete a specific\ndocument like _id \n\n[db.books.deleteOne({_id:ObjectId(\"22a3bc0f493f1330ba0cd3c\"})]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ukBE_QXhe4RSnylJnuHrE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -10398.522693038536,
      "y": 200943.0807066227,
      "width": 9057.775512695312,
      "height": 4775.884704259343,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 476210253,
      "version": 331,
      "versionNonce": 2023012845,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731319117957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.deleteMany():– Delete multiple documents that match the\nfilter.\n\nThis command deletes all documents that match the given\nfilter.\n\nSyntax is :\ndb.collection.deleteMany({ <filter> })\n\nExample:\ndb.books.deleteMany({ author: \"Brandon Sanderson\" })\n\nthis will delete all documents in the \"books\" collection\nwhere the \"author\" field is \"Brandon Sanderson\"  ",
      "fontSize": 272.9076973862482,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.deleteMany():– Delete multiple documents that match the filter.\n\nThis command deletes all documents that match the given filter.\n\nSyntax is :\ndb.collection.deleteMany({ <filter> })\n\nExample:\ndb.books.deleteMany({ author: \"Brandon Sanderson\" })\n\nthis will delete all documents in the \"books\" collection where the \"author\" field is \"Brandon Sanderson\"  ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
